+# Aegis — Model Lifecycle, Training Orchestration & Observability
+
+This patch adds a lightweight but production-oriented stack to complete model lifecycle:
+
+- MLflow server (docker-compose) for experiment tracking and model registry.
+- Simple feature store backed by S3 + sqlite index (services/feature_store).
+- DVC-lite dataset snapshot helper that uploads dataset snapshots to object store and records manifests (services/dvc).
+- Argo Workflow for training pipeline (k8s/argo/training-workflow.yaml) invoking a trainer container.
+- Example trainer (services/training/train.py) that logs runs to MLflow and attempts to cosign model artifacts.
+- Scheduled retrain flow via GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/auto_retrain.yml) that triggers Argo training and runs promote checks.
+- Promotion guard (services/promotion/check_and_promote.py) that inspects MLflow metrics and opens an A2A approval for promotion if thresholds pass.
+- Drift detector (services/monitoring/drift_detector.py) that compares baseline statistics and emits a drift score to Prometheus or MCP.
+- Metrics exporter for Prometheus (services/monitoring/metrics_exporter.py).
+- Infra bootstrap helper (k8s/infra/provision.sh) to create placeholder secrets and configmaps (operator must replace with IaC).
+- Key rotation helper (services/security/key_rotation.py) showing operator workflow for secret rotation.
